                                                "sense_id": "c8a25761-ac23-3bcb-be0a-e44621c677fe",
                                                "text": "In addition to the long-standing relationship with Felixstowe (GBRf now carries a third of all containerised rail traffic arising from that port), operations have expanded at two other deep-sea ports - Southampton and Thames Gateway."
